{"id":"bh8ainjctas69916ozijlhq6m","title":"PHP 发布 8.5.12 等版本修复两个可远程执行代码的漏洞，并说明安全流程改革","originalTitle":"Today's PHP security release, and how we're strengthening security","summary":"PHP 项目发布 8.5.12、8.4.27、8.3.36 和 8.2.35，修复两个关键漏洞：CVE-2026-109618（内存耗尽导致的内存损坏，可在 Apache mod_php 默认配置下由未认证请求触发远程代码执行）和 CVE-2026-109619（致命错误遗留的过期状态导致释放后使用，已在真实应用上演示远程代码执行），实际 CVSS 评分为 9.2。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://thephp.foundation/blog/2026/10/21/todays-php-security-release-and-how-were-strengthening-php-security/"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-21T15:48:56.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-21T16:07:35.983Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-21T16:07:35.983Z","category":"security-privacy","tags":["安全漏洞","版本发布","技术方案"],"score":85,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"supply-chain-security","name":"供应链与依赖安全"},{"slug":"major-release","name":"重大版本发布"},{"slug":"security-fix","name":"安全修复与漏洞"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}